{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-8","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If a number be the same parts of a number that a number subtracted is of a number subtracted, the remainder will also be the same parts of the remainder that the whole is of the whole.","book":7,"number":8,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.8","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.8/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":8,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","contentId":"euclid-7-8","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"676af9e76732fc6c3543c177d29c80b49d907b1b028f52f87c8b4341fd05ef76","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-8.statement","euclid-7-8.construction.1","euclid-7-8.construction.2","euclid-7-8.proof.1","euclid-7-8.construction.3","euclid-7-8.proof.2","euclid-7-8.construction.4","euclid-7-8.proof.3","euclid-7-8.proof.4","euclid-7-8.construction.5","euclid-7-8.proof.5","euclid-7-8.proof.6","euclid-7-8.conclusion","euclid-7-8.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-8.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f31429a71543a9b0e638868d238daf4854c2fde6b654cdf7e9f725f56bbeaa82","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a number be the same parts of a number that a number subtracted is of a number subtracted, the remainder will also be the same parts of the remainder that the whole is of the whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果数字与减去数字的数相同,则其余部分与整个数字相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-8.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ac2f6efea61e26c44f920f51a6ae8a0c320c95b7a5adad3433187ef739297a2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the number AB be the same parts of the number CD that AE subtracted is of CF subtracted; I say that the remainder EB is also the same parts of the remainder FD that the whole AB is of the whole CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB数字与AE数字的CD数字相同,AE数字减去CF数字;我说,其余EB数字与其余FD数字的AB数字相同,CD数字全部为CD数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-8.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d816501520929aadec1aa491a3d3e1169ecdcf5c7737beef418a09eafc880696","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let GH be made equal to AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让GH等于AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-8.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e0af2e7a93ae1834e8493e9430e8a06b7d2af7079d41f3ff883df9171f8e67b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, whatever parts GH is of CD, the same parts also is AE of CF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,无论GH部分为CD部分,CF部分中也为AE部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-8.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e684e946cc259109fc14e32b850eecaa0696e7b457374e9dbc64438ac29d5766","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let GH be divided into the parts of CD, namely GK, KH, and AE into the parts of CF, namely AL, LE; thus the multitude of GK, KH will be equal to the multitude of AL, LE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让GH分为CD,即GK、KH和AE,即CF,即AL、LE;因此,GK、KH将相当于AL、LE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-8.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1e6356c1b3b0e4480427afd6d59723e16b5191153d8787729437982f45b7d108","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since, whatever part GK is of CD, the same part also is AL of CF, while. CD is greater than CF, therefore GK is also greater than AL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,无论第GK部分是CD部分,CF部分中也只有AL部分,CD部分大于CF部分,因此GK部分也大于AL部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-8.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"62d6e5211369f96bf3d1433556c0ae03624347b83d02b88815e559e0be669f7b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let GM be made equal to AL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让GM等于AL"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-8.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"78baae1fc8782c0e4949921ae12f00ba70bdb6bbdf440c6bf12e724b864124d2","citations":["euclid-7-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, whatever part GK is of CD, the same part also is GM of CF; therefore also the remainder MK is the same part of the remainder FD that the whole GK is of the whole CD. [[VII. 7](/principles/euclid-7-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,无论第GK部分是CD部分,同一部分也是CF部分中的GM部分;因此,其余MK部分是其余FD部分,即整个GK部分是CD部分的同一部分。 [[VII. 7](/principles/euclid-7-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-8.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f58ed5b6b4357b67869f63fdd8c86a499529b15499863b6685be078411bdcbce","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since, whatever part KH is of CD, the same part also is EL of CF, while CD is greater than CF, therefore HK is also greater than EL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于第KH部分无论CD部分是哪部分,CF部分也是EL部分,CD部分大于CF,因此HK部分也大于EL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-8.construction.5","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":9,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9ca6d8dfc3b6b16bea1dfd9cdc9cc8ed7ea1b1a65aa7117fac2c4de65aad42d5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let KN be made equal to EL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让KN等于EL"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-8.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d18e4e2773ba1809f96a12564fd7892447ec12db409ca45334f6efd6bddb15d5","citations":["euclid-7-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, whatever part KH is of CD, the same part also is KN of CF; therefore also the remainder NH is the same part of the remainder FD that the whole KH is of the whole CD. [[VII. 7](/principles/euclid-7-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,无论第KH部分是CD部分,同一部分也是CF部分中的KN部分;因此,其余NH部分是其余FD部分,即整个KH部分是CD部分的同一部分。 [[VII. 7](/principles/euclid-7-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-8.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e71c6bba4d41ad7832a2c4ec23e5cf4a73be46fc6cf0f36270ab785a0a4a5e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the remainder MK was also proved to be the same part of the remainder FD that the whole GK is of the whole CD; therefore also the sum of MK, NH is the same parts of DF that the whole HG is of the whole CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但其余MK也证明是其余FD中的同一部分,即整个GK为CD;因此,MK、NH与整个DF中的HG相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-8.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ee1a5a8a461b5ea1ab704b7d27e9b830f798974accc3b8a0bfb9e9af626fc555","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the sum of MK, NH is equal to EB, and HG is equal to BA; therefore the remainder EB is the same parts of the remainder FD that the whole AB is of the whole CD. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但MK,NH的总数等于EB,HG等于BA;因此,其余的EB是其余的FD,AB是全部的CD,Q,E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-8.source","contentId":"euclid-7-8","revisionId":"euclid-7-8@raw-676af9e76732fc6c","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ee496c7bf2a2fc44a9bf973aeb1aeef4dde33fe50f2a38e1a67cda789b246fda","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.8/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.8\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-8:euclid-7-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-8.proof.3","euclid-7-8.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"VII. 7"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-11:euclid-7-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-11","sourceBlockIds":[],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"VII. 7, 8"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-8:euclid-7-7:explicit","id":"euclid-7-7","book":7,"number":7,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-7-11:euclid-7-8:explicit","id":"euclid-7-11","book":7,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
